      "id": "blog-1",
      "title": "Prime Real Estate Trends in Islamabad: Margalla Foothills & Sector E-7",
      "slug": "prime-real-estate-trends-islamabad-margalla",
      "excerpt": "An analytical breakdown of capital appreciation, architectural evolution, and foreign buyer demand across Islamabad's most coveted sectors.",
      "content": "Islamabad's prime residential landscape has experienced an unprecedented flight to quality over the past 24 months. As international standards of architectural design converge with growing demand from overseas nationals and diplomatic missions, sectors like E-7, F-6, and F-7 have maintained resilient valuations and heightened transaction velocity.\n\nKey drivers include the scarcity of prime corner plots, strict zoning protections, and the introduction of turnkey architectural residences built to international energy-efficiency standards. Buyers are increasingly prioritizing perimeter security, integrated solar generation, and bespoke finishes over raw square footage.",
      "category": "Market Insights",
      "author": {
        "name": "Alexander Vance",
